Subject: [PATCH 1093/1252] Artwork (1120): in the player, on the Librarian's
 cards, in the media panel, in the take menu; the MP3 download carries it as
 its front cover (APIC), made again when the artwork is newer

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
